add(['M2-T004'], 'Freeze the audio buffer and lifecycle contract experimentally before production DSP/engine code.', ['M2-T003 DONE; ADR-004 remains Proposed.'], ['Define planar f32 mono/stereo buffer representation.','Define prepare(sample_rate, max_block_size, channels) semantics.','Define process preconditions and invalid-host behavior.','Define reset/reprepare semantics.','Test variable block sizes including 1 sample and large blocks.'], ['Buffer shape/property tests; lifecycle sequence tests; invalid input tests.'], ['cargo test --workspace --all-features'], ['Buffer contract is explicit.','Invalid host behavior is safe and deterministic.','prepare/reprepare/reset semantics are testable.'], ['crates/romueq-engine/','crates/romueq-common/','docs/decisions/'])
